title The narrowest family returned the most, and the meter's own arithmetic said why
prompt Run one lap of the autonomous loop: Standfast on reds first, then the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first on the Caravan lift arc, honoring the mechanism sentence.
think Standfast opened the lap. The era suite runs GREEN at nine rungs, so the constructive queue is free. One stale claim surfaced in the running: era 7/9 recited 18 planted cases after the commit-guard roster moved to 20 the round before. My own drift, one lap old, fixed in this lap rather than booked.
think Read the harness before the meter, which is the arc's own first teaching. Hashed all three candidate families across the 110 modules before writing a line: may_pass, hand_path, seat_the_ground.
think The hash reordered the queue again. may_pass is 51 rungs by carried lines and is really five families -- 51, 4, and three singletons -- over a six-line signature, returning about 600. seat_the_ground is one family of 43 by 21 over a five-line signature, about 630. hand_path is one uniform family of 34 by 27 over a ONE-line signature, about 825. The narrowest family returned the most, for the second lap running.
think Checked the contract before writing it. All four symbols the body reaches -- max_note_path_len, NoteError, addressable, reader_dir -- already stood public in all 34, so the fold widens nothing anywhere on the ladder. The fifth in a row to need none. hand_path itself is private in all 34 and the stub stays private, since only each rung's own body calls it.
think Found a design question the queue could not see: hand_path is a near-twin of tell_path, already lifted into the harness, differing only in its suffix and in the companion each comptime assert pairs it with. Mirrored rather than merged, and booked the merge, because folding a second family of 29 into this lap would widen it past one keystone.
obs Prediction and measurement agree exactly, and the arithmetic is the meter's own rather than mine. The scan counts carried as (copies - 1) times lines, so the family contributed 33 times 27 before and 33 times 3 after: a fall of 792. Measured 792. My first estimate of 789 used the wrong model and was corrected by reading the scan's awk rather than by adjusting the story.
obs The harness body costs the carry meter nothing, because a unique body has no duplicate copies to count. That is worth saying plainly: it is why a fold reads as a fall rather than as a cost moved somewhere cheaper, and it is the same fact the delegate reading exists to keep honest.
obs Rota row 4, Earth and Mercury, the concrete -- and both halves landed on this lap directly. Two Rooms says a living claim about behavior earns the checkable room only when a witness binds it, which is exactly what the mechanism-sentence meter did for a prose habit the round before. The Marked Value says every value crossing a seam wears a mark naming its type, which is the harness pattern stated as a principle: the rung hands its own type in, and the shared body reads the rung's nouns off that mark.
loom witness=caravan_suite_witness rungs=107 verdict=green
