file caravan/ladder_checks.rye the lifted hand_path, taking the rung as a comptime type parameter and reaching all four contract symbols through it
file caravan/abate.rye one of thirty-four rungs whose twenty-seven-line body became a three-line call
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish the ceiling down to 81,048, the body figures resynced, and the fold-queue narration rewritten for this lap
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh the ceiling default moved with the assert that reads it
file tools/glow_tend_era_suite.rish era 7/9 recites 20 planted cases across three rules, matching the roster it runs
file crux/REMEMBER.md the Now refilled with this lap and the booked reader_path merge
recommend keep-going the queue's next head by realized fall is seat_the_ground at 43 rungs by 21 lines over a five-line signature, giving back about 630 -- hash its bodies first, since two laps running have now found the queue's rung count to be a floor rather than the family. may_pass at 51 by 19 ranks above it by carried lines and below it by realized fall, and its 51 is five families rather than one. Beside them the booked reader_path merge would fold hand_path and tell_path into one body taking suffix and companion as comptime parameters, keeping both asserts exactly; that is its own round across 63 rungs and wants a clear lap. The machine half of the address space stays owed, and the libsel4 generator gate (jinja2, ply) is still Keaton's word.
